r `~/.hermes/skills/` or in the Hermes source tree is not used by","+  this install and can carry a stale tier table; remove it by hand."," - **A saved `delegation.backend` does not change a running chat.** The","   `delegate_task` schema is cached in the prompt prefix, so a config edit","   applies from the next session (`/new`), not the current one. Verify the"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/tiiny-router/references/backend.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FE4v3qLXbvtgFTXisENdAc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
