=$HOME/.hermes/tiiny-lock-b.json \\"," TIINY_HOLD_FILE=$HOME/.hermes/tiiny-hold-b.json \\"," TIINY_PLAN_FILE=$HOME/.hermes/tiiny-plan-b.json \\","-python3 scripts/tiiny_ctl.py status","+npx hermes-tiiny-router ctl status"," ```"," ","-The mesh is the simpler door for both boxes when one is in front of them:","-`POST /mesh/lifecycle` with `action: start|stop|download` and a `target`.","-"," ---"," "," ## 3. The work order"]},{"oldStart":212,"oldLines":7,"newStart":207,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - **A rewrite that changes what a sentence says is a corruption, not a","   fix.** Path tokens appear inside prose that *describes* a path — \"the","   design system links to `../brand/tap-monogram.png`\" — and rewriting","-  that mention to a vault-absolute path breaks the sentence's claim","+  that mention to an absolute path breaks the sentence's claim","   while looking like a repair. After a bulk rewrite, read the changed","   lines in context: a mention inside a description keeps its original","   form, and only a genuine link target gets rebased."]},{"oldStart":301,"oldLines":10,"newStart":296,"newLines":9,"lines":[" "," ## 9. During a delegated run, stop the auto-loader"," ","-A gateway that puts the appliances back to their default models at startup","-will evict the specialist you just loaded, mid-batch. The TiinyMesh","-gateway has an `auto_restore` flag for exactly this — see the","-`tiiny-mesh-multi-target` skill.","+Anything that puts the appliances back to their default models on its own","+will evict the specialist you just loaded, mid-batch. Turn it off for the","+length of the run."," "," ---"," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/tiiny-router/references/coding-delegation.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RbiVXFqMgMRg6ZFFQGvbWq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
