{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017fMLCwirLFM8CeJSXx8Qoa","type":"tool_result","content":"# Image models on the device\n\nThe appliance runs the image models as well as the chat ones, and picking the\nright one is the difference between an image that works and an afternoon.\n\nThe controller picks from what is actually on the device:\n\n```bash\nnpx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a realistic portrait of an engineer\"\nnpx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a logo with the word ARC in it\"\nnpx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a character turnaround, three views\"\nnpx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"...\" --load      # load it as well\n```\n\nIt prints the model, the reason it was chosen, the NPU share, and whether the\nmodel is on the device and currently resident.\n\n## The models, and what each is for\n\nFigures read from the device on 2026-11-01.\n`~/.hermes/.env` for the two key env vars by name and never prints a value.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95803e3d-040d-4401-b98c-4ca7b716b706","uuid":"159c42db-8d3e-41d4-9e08-564534fd8904","timestamp":"2026-11-21T05:59:53.763Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Image models on the device\n\nThe appliance runs the image models as well as the chat ones, and picking the\nright one is the difference between an image that works and an afternoon.\n\nThe controller picks from what is actually on the device:\n\n```bash\nnpx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a realistic portrait of an engineer\"\nnpx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a logo with the word ARC in it\"\nnpx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a character turnaround, three views\"\nnpx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"...\" --load      # load it as well\n```\n\nIt prints the model, the reason it was chosen, the NPU share, and whether the\nmodel is on the device and currently resident.\n\n## The models, and what each is for\n\nFigures read from the device on 2026-11-01.\n`~/.hermes/.env` for the two key env vars by name and never prints a value.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/tiiny-router/references/image-models.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":6,"oldLines":10,"newStart":6,"newLines":10,"lines":[" The controller picks from what is actually on the device:"," "," ```bash","-python3 scripts/tiiny_ctl.py image \"a realistic portrait of an engineer\"","-python3 scripts/tiiny_ctl.py image \"a logo with the word ARC in it\"","-python3 scripts/tiiny_ctl.py image \"a character turnaround, three views\"","-python3 scripts/tiiny_ctl.py image \"...\" --load      # load it as well","+npx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a realistic portrait of an engineer\"","+npx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a logo with the word ARC in it\"","+npx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"a character turnaround, three views\"","+npx hermes-tiiny-router ctl image \"...\" --load      # load it as well"," ```"," "," It prints the model, the reason it was chosen, the NPU share, and whether the"]},{"oldStart":33,"oldLines":7,"newStart":33,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | `SenseTime/SenseNova-U1.5-8B-MoT` | 48% | A larger unified creation model | not downloaded |"," "," **This skill never downloads a model.** A model that is not on the device","-cannot be loaded, so `tiiny_ctl.py image` says which models are missing and","+cannot be loaded, so `ctl image` says which models are missing and"," lets you download them yourself with `tiiny download <model>`."," "," ## Name the job, not the picture"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/tiiny-router/references/lifecycle.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":35,"oldLines":7,"newStart":35,"newLines":7,"lines":[" {","   \"state\": \"held\",","   \"owner\": \"<agent>\",","-  \"task\": \"vault index + research sweep\",","+  \"task\": \"notes index + research sweep\","," 