cto-snapshot.json \\","-  python3 scripts/tiiny_ctl.py status","+  npx hermes-tiiny-router ctl status"," ```"," ","-**Concurrent load, verified** — start the same model on both boxes from two","-threads, then read residency back from each device:","-","-```python","-import json, threading, urllib.request","-key = open(os.path.expanduser(\"~/.hermes/mesh/gateway_key\")).read().strip()","-def post(target):","-    body = json.dumps({\"action\": \"start\", \"model\": MODEL, \"target\": target}).encode()","-    r = urllib.request.Request(\"http://127.0.0.1:8767/mesh/lifecycle\", data=body,","-        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {key}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},","-        method=\"POST\")","-    urllib.request.urlopen(r, timeout=120)","-```","-","-Both answers are `ok` and both models land; the incumbents survive because the","-requested model fit the free share. Undo with the same call and `action: stop`","-— always leave the residency you found.","+**Concurrent load, verified.** Start the same model on both boxes from two","+threads, each with `POST /api/v1/models/<id>/start` against that box's own","+address and bearer, then read residency back from each device. Both answers","+are `ok` and both models land; the incumbents survive because the requested","+model fit the free share. Undo with `/stop` on each box -- always leave the","+residency you found."," "," **The two boxes do not agree on error shape, so never judge by the response"," code.** Stopping a model that was not resident returned HTTP 500"]},{"oldStart":192,"oldLines":7,"newStart":180,"newLines":8,"lines":[" "," ## Reproducible script"," ","-`scripts/tiiny_two_box_matrix.py` (in this skill directory) runs the whole","+`scripts/tiiny_two_box_matrix.py` (in the installed directory,","+`$HERMES_HOME/plugins/tiiny-router/`) runs the whole"," read-only pass: fetches both catalogues, classifies every model with the"," evidence recorded, writes the markdown matrix, and re-reads both devices to"," verify every headline number before exiting non-zero on any mismatch."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/tiiny-router/references/image-models.md","/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/tiiny-router/references/lifecycle.md","/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/tiiny-router/references/project-role-selection.md","/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/tiiny-router/references/two-box-capability-matrix.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017fMLCwirLFM8CeJSXx8Qoa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
