f the\ncontroller. Change the list in the package and run `install` again; an edit\nmade in the installed directory is a local edit, which `install` refuses to\noverwrite without `--force` and `doctor` reports.\n\n**Trimming is a functional decision, not just an NPU decision.** Hermes's own\n`stt` and `tts` providers used to point at the appliance, and TTS has no\non-demand load path — a TTS model that is not resident makes `text_to_speech`\nfail. That constraint is gone: speech now lives on the Mac's OffGrid gateway,\nwhich serves it from its own process at no NPU cost. The appliance's speech models were unloaded\non 2026-11-10 and are no longer in the required set.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KY9qo7q4AJRCQsTxMeLCbV","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
