{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0135zpbj1ewcMEuvvxP32uWf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# AGENTS.md\n2\t\n3\tThis is a Hermes delegation backend. When Hermes hands a subtask to a\n4\tsubagent with its `delegate_task` tool, the plugin picks a Tiiny model for\n5\tthat subtask based on what kind of work it is. Indexing goes to\n6\t`gpt-oss-20b`, coding to `Qwen3.6-35B-A3B`, browser work to `Qwen3.8-27B`,\n7\tand so on.\n8\t\n9\tThe plugin expects a Hermes provider named `tiiny`.\n10\t\n11\tthe install steps are:\n12\t\n13\t1. Copy the plugin into Hermes’s delegation plugins folder.\n14\t2. Add `TIINY_API_KEY` to `~/.hermes/.env`.\n15\t3. Add the `tiiny` provider to the config.\n16\t4. Set `delegation.backend`: `tiiny-router`.\n17\t5. Edit `tiers.py` so it lists only models you’ve downloaded.\n18\t6. Check the routing with `route_check.py`, then restart the gateway.\n19\t\n20\t\n21\t<!-- redeye:start -->\n22\t## Agent skills\n23\t\n24\t### Issue tracker\n25\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"95803e3d-040d-4401-b98c-4ca7b716b706","uuid":"4f5b04de-aa95-4869-8e01-736bf58dfd00","timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:02:20.540Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/AGENTS.md","content":"# AGENTS.md\n\nThis is a Hermes delegation backend. When Hermes hands a subtask to a\nsubagent with its `delegate_task` tool, the plugin picks a Tiiny model for\nthat subtask based on what kind of work it is. Indexing goes to\n`gpt-oss-20b`, coding to `Qwen3.6-35B-A3B`, browser work to `Qwen3.8-27B`,\nand so on.\n\nThe plugin expects a Hermes provider named `tiiny`.\n\nthe install steps are:\n\n1. Copy the plugin into Hermes’s delegation plugins folder.\n2. Add `TIINY_API_KEY` to `~/.hermes/.env`.\n3. Add the `tiiny` provider to the config.\n4. Set `delegation.backend`: `tiiny-router`.\n5. Edit `tiers.py` so it lists only models you’ve downloaded.\n6. Check the routing with `route_check.py`, then restart the gateway.\n\n\n<!-- redeye:start -->\n## Agent skills\n\n### Issue tracker\n","numLines":25,"startLine":1,"totalLines":140}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0135zpbj1ewcMEuvvxP32uWf","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
