{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChFZmXGEPZRJdF6DxDtKM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CDju9oLw5GETHJSSJEx3Lh","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.hermes-plugin-package-12-docs-for-package-install/AGENTS.md","old_string":"the install steps are:\n\n1. Copy the plugin into Hermes’s delegation plugins folder.\n2. Add `TIINY_API_KEY` to `~/.hermes/.env`.\n3. Add the `tiiny` provider to the config.\n4. Set `delegation.backend`: `tiiny-router`.\n5. Edit `tiers.py` so it lists only models you’ve downloaded.\n6. Check the routing with `route_check.py`, then restart the gateway.\n","new_string":"The install steps are (the user-facing version is `README.md`):\n\n1. Run `npx hermes-tiiny-router install`. It copies `tiiny-router/` to\n   `$HERMES_HOME/plugins/tiiny-router/` and runs `hermes plugins validate`.\n2. Add `TIINY_API_KEY` to `~/.hermes/.env` by hand; the installer never\n   touches that file.\n3. Let the config step add the `tiiny` provider and set\n   `delegation.backend: tiiny-router` (prompted, or `--configure`).\n4. Run `npx hermes-tiiny-router doctor`, check a goal with\n   `npx hermes-tiiny-router route-check \"...\"`, then restart the gateway.\n\nUpgrade is `install` again; `uninstall` removes the directory only.\n\nDocs rules for every markdown file and the skill: no em dashes (use\n`--`) and no arrow characters (use `->`), except inside a literal that\nthe code prints, such as the `off→low` route label.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"cache_read_input_tokens":142556,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":825},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"c